# Name values

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-name-value/SKILL.md`. Design notes: `docs/structured-name-model.md`.

- Use `namevalues.Insert` / `Lookup`; required `form`; optional ordered parts.
- Part `type` is an open vocabulary (starter consts only); do not close it in DDL.
- Schema changes go through catalog migrations; do not invent a parallel name store.
- Format profiles (`name_format_*`) are separate — not this package.
